      "updated": 1792399332742,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Drawbacks of Linear queue\n---------------------------------\n\n1. Even if the space is available at linear queue it\nprint message queue overflow on enqueue when\nfront is at last index and rear is not at 0 .\n\n2. If we keep on increamenting front , at last\nstage front will exceed the boundary of queue .\n\n\nSolution\n----------\n\n1. On Deletion Instead of increamenting front\nshift all the elements downwards by one . But this\nsolution is practical on small data only .\n\n2. Convert linear queue into circular queue .\n\n\nCircular Queue\n=============\n\n1. Circular queue is a variation of Linaer queue\nsuch that when front and rear reaches the last\nindex they move to index 0.\n\n2. Due this circular nature it is called circular\nqueue .\n\nBenefits\n------------\n\n1. Untill and unless queue is not fully occupied it\nwill not give queue overflow .\n\n2. front will not cross the boundary .\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Drawbacks of Linear queue\n---------------------------------\n\n1. Even if the space is available at linear queue it print message queue overflow on enqueue when front is at last index and rear is not at 0 .\n\n2. If we keep on increamenting front , at last stage front will exceed the boundary of queue .\n\n\nSolution\n----------\n\n1. On Deletion Instead of increamenting front shift all the elements downwards by one . But this solution is practical on small data only .\n\n2. Convert linear queue into circular queue .\n\n\nCircular Queue\n=============\n\n1. Circular queue is a variation of Linaer queue such that when front and rear reaches the last index they move to index 0.\n\n2. Due this circular nature it is called circular queue .\n\nBenefits\n------------\n\n1. Untill and unless queue is not fully occupied it will not give queue overflow .\n\n2. front will not cross the boundary .\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
