      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792402429379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Algorithm for enqueue in circular queue\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the queue is full or not .\n\n2. If queue is full print queue overflow and return .\n\n3. When queue is not full then adjust the REAR .\n\n4. Insert the element at REAR index .\n\n5. If this first element set FRONT at index 0 .\n\n\nAlgorithm for dequeue in circular queue\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the queue is empty or not .\n\n2. If queue is empty print queue underflow and return .\n\n3. When queue is not empty delete the element pointed by FRONT.\n\n4. Adjust FRONT and if required adjust REAR also .\n\n5. Return the deleted element .\n\n\nAlgorithm for peek in circular queue\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the queue is empty or not .\n\n2. If queue is empty print queue underflow and return .\n\n3. If queue is not empty return the element at index FRONT .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Algorithm for enqueue in circular queue\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the queue is full or not .\n\n2. If queue is full print queue overflow and return .\n\n3. When queue is not full then adjust the REAR .\n\n4. Insert the element at REAR index .\n\n5. If this first element set FRONT at index 0 .\n\n\nAlgorithm for dequeue in circular queue\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the queue is empty or not .\n\n2. If queue is empty print queue underflow and return .\n\n3. When queue is not empty delete the element pointed by FRONT.\n\n4. Adjust FRONT and if required adjust REAR also .\n\n5. Return the deleted element .\n\n\nAlgorithm for peek in circular queue\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the queue is empty or not .\n\n2. If queue is empty print queue underflow and return .\n\n3. If queue is not empty return the element at index FRONT .",
